# Unreal Engine: generated and cached files, rebuilt by the editor.
*/Binaries/
*/Intermediate/
*/Saved/
*/DerivedDataCache/
*/.vs/
*/Build/
*/Platforms/
*.sln
*.suo
*.VC.db
*.opendb
# Unreal's MCP connection file is per machine (port, local URL).
*/.mcp.json
# Third-party character assets (MetaHumans, Fab packs): their licences do not allow
# redistributing the raw assets in this public repo. See docs/CHARACTERS.md.
*/Content/MetaHumans/
*/Content/ThirdParty/
# MetaHuman outfits (MetaHuman SDK's default Outfits path), Fab ones included.
*/Content/Outfits/
# Fab packs added through the editor's Fab panel land in their own Content folder.
*/Content/AnimalVarietyPack/
